  "body": "## Disposition\n\n**Original problem unresolved, 5/5 substantive author turns.** The exact source permits three arbitrary nonconstant entire inputs and an ambient entire F bounded on their full separated-sum zero hypersurface.\n\nThe strongest explicit sufficient class proved here allows just one input `R(exp(Q))`, with R a nonconstant Laurent polynomial and Q a nonconstant polynomial; both other inputs are arbitrary entire. Other retained results include exact polynomial-precomposition equivalence, a virtually-nilpotent inverse-monodromy criterion, and character/finite-dimensional-deck-orbit rigidity on the triple-double-exponential test. No source counterexample or full resolution is claimed.\n\n## Source qualification and credit\n\nRubel\u2013Squires\u2013Taylor irreducibility is a credited established dependency. Its precise statement and attribution were checked in Demailly's primary publication; the original full Annals proof was not retrieved. The review checks its applicability, not a reconstruction of that missing proof. Demailly\u2013Wakabayashi, the known polynomial-input and two-simple-exponential cases, and Lin's ultra-Liouville covering theorem are credited. No historical novelty certification is made.\n\n## Review and artifacts\n\nFull independent AI-assisted source/proof review: PASS without mandatory correction. All five author receipts replay exactly (38,066 assertions), with 1,420 independent exact controls. These supplement the analytic proofs; they do not replace them. OpenAI tools assisted research, drafting and review; independent algebra checks also use SymPy. This is not human peer review.\n\nStart at [PUBLICATION_STATUS.md](https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/blob/d9e4600d05b8272fe913a22ae7dcc0fbe0a26344/unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/2302055/PUBLICATION_STATUS.md), then RESULT, all five proofs and the independent review.\n\nAll 40 author files and six bound review files are unchanged. Only three additive publication wrappers and this target's QUEUE status/turn cells are added or updated, using fresh main plus final author ancestry. The unbound working audit, raw PDFs and imported records are excluded. Draft only; no merge or release requested.",
